#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "An integer E<gt>= 1 and E<lt>= MB_LEN_MAX.  The value 1 denotes "
#| "traditional 8-bit encoded characters."
msgid ""
"An integer in the range [1, B<MB_LEN_MAX>].  The value 1 denotes traditional "
"8-bit encoded characters."
msgstr ""
"Un entero E<gt>= 1 y E<lt>= MB_LEN_MAX.  El valor 1 denota caracteres "
"tradicionales codificados en 8 bits."

